{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17753","headline":"张郎中段员外初直翰林报寄长句 · 杨巨源","name":"张郎中段员外初直翰林报寄长句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋空如练瑞云明，天上人间莫问程。\n丹凤词头供二妙，金銮殿角直三清。\n方瞻北极临星月，犹向南班滞姓名。\n啓沃朝朝深禁里，香炉烟外是公卿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨巨源","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17753.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17753","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}